283
00:13:16,240 --> 00:13:19,120
But because the temperature was too low
and he was exhausted,

284
00:13:19,320 --> 00:13:21,320
he eventually died of hypothermia
and drowning.

285
00:13:21,480 --> 00:13:22,440
Results are in.

286
00:13:23,880 --> 00:13:25,040
The water in the victim's lungs

287
00:13:25,040 --> 00:13:26,720
matches the water sample
from the Fengshan Pond.

288
00:13:26,840 --> 00:13:27,840
So you're saying

289
00:13:28,120 --> 00:13:29,520
he was thrown into his own pond,

290
00:13:29,520 --> 00:13:31,120
chased by crocodiles,

291
00:13:31,160 --> 00:13:32,000
swam until he drowned,

292
00:13:32,840 --> 00:13:34,160
and then got eaten by them?

293
00:13:35,840 --> 00:13:37,640
That's what the autopsy shows.

294
00:13:37,880 --> 00:13:39,240
No restraint marks on his body.

295
00:13:39,520 --> 00:13:40,760
No signs of a struggle.

296
00:13:40,840 --> 00:13:42,840
So he was conscious
when he went into the water.

297
00:13:49,120 --> 00:13:50,120
Swimming in that water

298
00:13:50,120 --> 00:13:52,160
would've only been more painful
and harder.

299
00:13:52,880 --> 00:13:54,040
The killer knew that.

300
00:13:55,000 --> 00:13:57,040
Throwing a man who'd been starving
for over 24 hours,

301
00:13:57,040 --> 00:13:59,360
covered in wounds, into cold water,

302
00:13:59,880 --> 00:14:01,760
the killer never meant for him
to come out alive.

303
00:14:07,400 --> 00:14:08,200
Got it.

304
00:14:10,920 --> 00:14:12,200
DNA results are in.

305
00:14:12,520 --> 00:14:13,360
It's Zhang Xiaodong.

306
00:14:16,920 --> 00:14:18,120
You two aren't shocked?

307
00:14:20,280 --> 00:14:21,200
But I didn't get

308
00:14:21,840 --> 00:14:23,640
a warning letter
from the Executer this time.

309
00:14:26,320 --> 00:14:28,440
Zhang Xiaodong's accounts
look completely clean.

310
00:14:28,480 --> 00:14:29,800
Most of it goes through

311
00:14:30,080 --> 00:14:31,720
the Sun Foundation's account.

312
00:14:32,440 --> 00:14:33,320
But we found

313
00:14:33,320 --> 00:14:34,520
one unremarkable fund

314
00:14:34,520 --> 00:14:36,440
that regularly flows to a shell company.

315
00:14:36,800 --> 00:14:38,000
And behind that company

316
00:14:38,360 --> 00:14:40,240
are some
illegal online lending platforms.

317
00:14:40,560 --> 00:14:41,440
Online lending?

318
00:14:42,280 --> 00:14:44,360
Zhang Xiaodong's involved
in online lending?

319
00:14:44,640 --> 00:14:46,160
(Fund Channel of Sun Foundation Account)
Seems beneath

320
00:14:46,160 --> 00:14:47,320
(Zhang Xiaodong, Sun Group's controller)
someone like Zhang Xiaodong.

321
00:14:47,320 --> 00:14:48,320
That's not all.

322
00:14:48,520 --> 00:14:50,120
We just got a report from a citizen.

323
00:14:50,320 --> 00:14:52,760
Zhang Xiaodong personally carried out
violent debt collection

324
00:14:53,080 --> 00:14:54,800
that left a victim severely injured
and disabled.

325
00:14:55,000 --> 00:14:55,760
Also,

326
00:14:55,760 --> 00:14:56,520
the early controller

327
00:14:56,520 --> 00:14:58,680
of that online lending platform
under his name

328
00:14:58,680 --> 00:15:00,120
points to a man named Liu Jingping,

329
00:15:00,120 --> 00:15:01,480
(Key Crimes)
nicknamed Liu Sanhao.

330
00:15:01,480 --> 00:15:02,120
(Drove Jin Qingshan to his death)
The loan shark debt

331
00:15:02,120 --> 00:15:04,120
from Jin Keke's father
that Qin Ming mentioned

332
00:15:04,120 --> 00:15:05,360
also traces back to him.

333
00:15:23,040 --> 00:15:24,800
(His arrogant, despicable soul)

334
00:15:25,160 --> 00:15:26,920
(is so filthy it makes you sick.)

335
00:15:27,360 --> 00:15:29,120
(He put shackles on them,)

336
00:15:29,720 --> 00:15:31,640
(painted them like stars in the dark,)

337
00:15:32,160 --> 00:15:33,760
(then snuffed out every light.)

338
00:15:34,240 --> 00:15:35,200
(They weren't lives.)

339
00:15:35,200 --> 00:15:36,320
(Just collectibles.)

340
00:15:36,640 --> 00:15:37,240
(But he forgot)

341
00:15:37,840 --> 00:15:38,640
(that collectibles)

342
00:15:39,040 --> 00:15:41,920
(can resent the master
who stares at them.)

343
00:15:42,320 --> 00:15:43,120
(Now,)

344
00:15:43,200 --> 00:15:45,480
(it's his turn to be the prey
on display.)

345
00:15:45,680 --> 00:15:48,200
(In that cold, dark swamp,)

346
00:15:48,280 --> 00:15:50,840
(his prized cold-bloodedness and greed)

347
00:15:51,080 --> 00:15:53,000
(look pathetic and weak)

348
00:15:53,120 --> 00:15:55,200
(in front of his true kind.)

349
00:15:55,960 --> 00:15:58,480
(Listen. The sound
of bones being torn apart)

350
00:15:59,200 --> 00:16:02,080
(is the highest tribute to him
as a collectible.)

351
00:16:06,460 --> 00:16:09,380
(Good Luck, Chongqing Specialty Hotpot)

352
00:16:13,080 --> 00:16:14,360
Hello, how many of you?

353
00:16:15,880 --> 00:16:16,640
Okay.

354
00:16:16,640 --> 00:16:18,080
Can you handle spicy food?

355
00:16:18,080 --> 00:16:19,760
Our specialty is Chongqing hot pot.

356
00:16:20,360 --> 00:16:21,840
Red oil. Extra spicy.

357
00:16:21,880 --> 00:16:22,680
Impressive.

358
00:16:22,720 --> 00:16:24,760
Table seven, red oil, extra spicy!

359
00:16:33,360 --> 00:16:34,160
(Laugh.)

360
00:16:34,440 --> 00:16:36,000
(You two deserve to rot together)

361
00:16:36,000 --> 00:16:36,880
(in that red oil.)

362
00:16:37,840 --> 00:16:39,680
(Borrower: Jin Qingshan)

363
00:17:00,540 --> 00:17:04,270
(Borrower: Jin Qingshan)

364
00:17:23,760 --> 00:17:25,360
Mom, here. It's not hot anymore.

365
00:17:27,560 --> 00:17:28,480
Jin Qingshan!

366
00:17:31,920 --> 00:17:32,760
Five hundred thousand.

367
00:17:33,000 --> 00:17:33,960
When are you paying it back?

368
00:17:34,680 --> 00:17:35,600
If you don't pay soon,

369
00:17:36,480 --> 00:17:38,320
I'll feed your mom myself.

370
00:17:38,320 --> 00:17:39,080
No, no!

371
00:17:39,360 --> 00:17:40,360
Qiang! Qiang...

372
00:17:41,680 --> 00:17:42,600
Qiang, please.

373
00:17:42,600 --> 00:17:44,080
Listen to me, I'll pay...

374
00:17:46,000 --> 00:17:47,000
Qiang.

375
00:17:47,520 --> 00:17:48,960
Qiang, listen... listen to me.

376
00:17:48,960 --> 00:17:50,000
Look at my mom.

377
00:17:50,000 --> 00:17:51,120
Can you give me a few more days?

378
00:17:51,120 --> 00:17:52,000
I'll pay it back, I swear.

379
00:17:52,000 --> 00:17:53,360
I... I'm begging you.

380
00:17:56,400 --> 00:17:57,200
Dad.

381
00:18:29,320 --> 00:18:33,540
♪Sunset washes over the old wall♪

382
00:18:34,060 --> 00:18:38,170
♪Milk tea cools on the stone steps♪

383
00:18:38,440 --> 00:18:42,430
♪Sea wind tugs at your sleeve♪

384
00:18:42,910 --> 00:18:46,730
♪Unspoken words just flee and fade♪

385
00:18:55,760 --> 00:18:59,650
♪The marks on the desk
have faded yellow♪

386
00:18:59,650 --> 00:19:02,450
♪I turned around,
and a gunshot rang out♪

387
00:19:03,140 --> 00:19:06,780
♪No one can truly feel another's pain♪

388
00:19:06,780 --> 00:19:11,000
♪The wind is cold,
a fading shadow sways♪

389
00:19:11,000 --> 00:19:15,730
♪Tonight, I don't care
about the universe♪

390
00:19:15,730 --> 00:19:20,170
♪I only want to see this through
with you♪

391
