♪The waves smooth
two lines of footprints♪

396
00:19:49,910 --> 00:19:52,810
♪Half a cup of sweetness
sinks into the sand♪

397
00:19:52,810 --> 00:19:57,590
♪Tonight, I don't care
about the universe♪

398
00:19:57,590 --> 00:20:02,250
♪I only want to see this through
with you♪

399
00:20:02,250 --> 00:20:04,560
♪Wind back to shore,
clouds back to hills♪

400
00:20:04,560 --> 00:20:06,630
♪We stop here in this night♪

401
00:20:06,630 --> 00:20:11,070
♪This is the past, the only,
the last look back♪

402
